      { "@type": "Question", "name": "How much does central heating installation cost in Liverpool?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "A full central heating fit in Liverpool starts at £3,500 for a smaller home. It can reach £6,000 to £7,000 for a larger one. A boiler replacement starts at £1,800. Adding one rad costs from £200 supply and fit. Every price covers the boiler, rads, pipework, controls and Gas Safe cert. We give a free written fixed-price quote after the site survey." } },
